      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Complete duplication of the bladder and urethra is a very rare congenital anomaly that is usually associated with other congenital anomalies. We report the case of a 7-year-old boy with complete duplication of the bladder and urethra in the anteroposterior plane, without any other associated congenital anomalies."},
